# The touch-move rule applies: a piece that has (preference)

Standing user preference: The touch-move rule applies: a piece that has been touched must be moved if a legal move exists with that piece.

## Conventions
- The touch-move rule applies: a piece that has been touched must be moved if a legal move exists with that piece.

